    {
      "name": "@local/longtask-relay",
      "title": {
        "en": "Long-task relay",
        "zh": "长任务接力"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Turn a long task into a session chain: the truth source lives in workspace files, and when context nears its limit the plugin wraps up, opens a fresh session, and hands the work over. The new session keeps the permission preset, goal, and plan mode. The panel lists what needs a human, shows the relay track, features, and truth source, and can pause, hand off, clear a blocker, or finish a chain.",
        "zh": "把长任务变成一条会话链：真理源落在工作区文件，上下文逼近上限时自动收尾、开新会话并交接，新会话沿用权限预设、目标和计划模式。面板集中列出需要人处理的事，可查看接力轨道、功能清单和真理源，并暂停、交接、解除阻塞或结束链。"
      },
      "icon": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/syncaus/dsh-plugins/main/dsh-longtask-relay-1.1.0/package/icon.svg",
      "author": "syncaus",
